WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.190
A long exposure.

00:01.898 --> 00:05.695
Stretch a long exposure further and the faintest outer parts appear.

00:06.127 --> 00:14.872
Each cloud and galaxy on this trip is drawn in three dimensions, built from measurements of its shape, its light taken from telescope photographs.

00:15.537 --> 00:18.553
Its card lets you compare it with the photograph itself.
